    <item>
      <title>Version 0.2.0</title>
      <sparkle:version>0.2.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 22:49:43 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>
&lt;h2&gt;What's New in FSeq 0.2.0&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Redesigned Renamer with PowerRename-inspired UI&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Vertical split layout with collapsible sections&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Token buttons for quick pattern insertion ($name, $date, $n, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Per-item checkboxes to exclude files from rename&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Visual case buttons [Aa] [aa] [AA] [Aa Aa]&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Wildcard support in search/replace&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Token support in replace field&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Undo support for rename operations (Ctrl+Z)&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Session-based and persistent history&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Store up to 20 operations for recovery after restart&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Auto-Update system via Sparkle (macOS) and WinSparkle (Windows)&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Check for Updates from tray menu and Help menu&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Automatic background update checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Improvements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Enhanced license security framework&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Preserve extension case in renamer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
